# Deny everything, then explicitly allow only what the build needs. Keeping the
# build context minimal speeds up `docker build` and stops unrelated file edits
# (docs, charts, IDE state, .git) from invalidating cached layers.
*

!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!global.json
!src/**/*.csproj
!src/**/*.cs
!src/**/appsettings*.json

# Re-excluded beneath the allow-list above, so local build output never reaches the context.
# The trailing /** matters: a bare **/obj would still send the matched files as empty stubs.
**/bin/**
**/obj/**
